# Live operating records belong to each colleague's local vault. The fictional
# starter records are already tracked; these rules protect newly created notes.
/CRM/Clients/*
/CRM/Contacts/*
/Habits/*
/Handoffs/*
/Meetings/*
/Milestones/*
/Notes/*
/Projects/*
/Scheduling Policies/*
/Tasks/*
/Work Sessions/*
